<title>MEXICO: Mexico's 28-day Cetes rate falls in auction.</title>
<headline>Mexico's 28-day Cetes rate falls in auction.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day Cetes rate fell slightly in this week's primary auction and demand also fell, Banco de Mexico said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Auction results were: (all rates in percent)</p>
<p>Maturity    Weighted Avg   Change (bps)  Min Rate  Max Rate</p>
<p>28-Day	22.93	    -05	     22.50     23.00</p>
<p>91-Day	24.16	    -27	     23.99     24.27</p>
<p>182-Day     24.63	    -05	     24.56     24.68</p>
<p>342-Day     25.86				25.50     25.95</p>
<p>Last week the 349-day paper was assigned at 25.54 pct.</p>
</text>
